  {
    "source": "IMG_4034.jpg",
    "slug": "nursing-home-chair",
    "title": "Sunlit Chairs",
    "category": "still-life",
    "categories": [],
    "location": "shanxi",
    "camera": "iphone",
    "lens": "",
    "condition": "clear",
    "conditions": [],
    "order": 1060,
    "note": "The chairs were placed by the window, facing the sunlight.\n\nIt seems that older people often like to sit in the sun.\n\nI found myself wondering:\nwhen he was twenty,\ncould he ever have imagined\nthat many years later\nhe would sit by a window,\nwarming himself in the light,\nand think back to being twenty?\n\n--------------------------\n\n椅子被摆在了窗边，迎着阳光。\n\n好像老人们都挺喜欢晒太阳的。\n\n我就在想，\n他二十岁的时候，\n会不会也没想过，\n很多年以后，\n自己会坐在窗边，\n一边晒太阳，\n一边想起二十岁。",
    "alt": "A yellow chair and a green chair sit by a sunlit window in a Shanxi nursing home."
  },
